+A walkthrough of the platform's full end-to-end functionality.
+
+Watch: [GitHub](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ffd8e81-8885-4412-a4d4-3339bbdba4fb)
+
+Also referenced in: [README](../README.md), [docs/index.md](index.md), [release notes v1.0.3](../release-notes/v1.0.3.md)
