+## Dynamic Tool Discovery
+
+Two different demo videos exist for this feature; both are listed here.
+
+### Dynamic Tool Discovery and Invocation
+
+The Dynamic Tool Discovery & Invocation demo referenced from the README and the docs landing page.
+
+Watch: [GitHub](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cee25b31-61e4-4089-918c-c3757f84518c)
+
+Also referenced in: [README](../README.md), [docs/index.md](index.md), [release notes v1.0.3](../release-notes/v1.0.3.md)
+
+### Dynamic Tool Discovery - Agent Integration
+
+Shows AI agents using dynamic tool discovery autonomously: the agent has access to both `intelligent_tool_finder` and `invoke_mcp_tool` and discovers and executes new capabilities on demand.
+
+Watch: [GitHub](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cee1847d-ecc1-406b-a83e-ebc80768430d)
+
+Also referenced in: [docs/dynamic-tool-discovery.md](dynamic-tool-discovery.md) (embedded twice: Agent Integration section and Demo section)
+
+## Agent Skills & Virtual MCP Servers
+
+### Agent Skills
+
+Covers registering, managing, and using Agent Skills in the registry.
+
+Watch: [GitHub](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d1f227a-25f8-480d-9ff9-acba2498844b)
+
+Also referenced in: [README](../README.md), [docs/agent-skills-operational-guide.md](agent-skills-operational-guide.md)
+
+### Virtual MCP Servers
+
+Demonstrates Virtual MCP Server creation and management through the web UI. Virtual servers aggregate tools from multiple backend MCP servers into a single unified endpoint.
+
+Watch: [Vidcast](https://app.vidcast.io/share/954e6296-f217-4559-8d86-88cec25af763)
+
+Also referenced in: [README](../README.md), [docs/virtual-server-operations.md](virtual-server-operations.md)
+
+## Federation & Integrations
+
+### ANS Integration Walkthrough
+
+Covers the Agent Name Service integration architecture, configuration, API usage, and operational procedures.
+
+Watch: [Vidcast](https://app.vidcast.io/share/c2240a78-8899-46ad-9375-6fb0cc1345f3?playerMode=vidcast)
+
+Also referenced in: [README](../README.md), [docs/design/ans-integration.md](design/ans-integration.md)
+
+### AWS Agent Registry Federation
+
+How to federate MCP servers, A2A agents, and agent skills from Amazon Bedrock AgentCore registries into the MCP Gateway Registry.
+
+Watch: [Vidcast](https://app.vidcast.io/share/6d2e0a43-4a68-477e-b5b9-2b3e2aa59f83?playerMode=vidcast)
+
+Also referenced in: [docs/aws-agent-registry-federation.md](aws-agent-registry-federation.md)
+
+### Peer-to-Peer Federation
+
+Setting up and operating peer-to-peer federation between MCP Gateway Registry instances.
+
+Watch: [GitHub](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/630ce847-b151-4eaa-9cc9-2ec77797f2b5)
+
+Also referenced in: [docs/federation-operational-guide.md](federation-operational-guide.md)
