+## Maintenance
+
+- This inventory was built by scanning the repository's markdown files for video URLs. To regenerate it:
+
+  ```
+  grep -rEoh 'https://(www\.youtube\.com/watch\?v=[A-Za-z0-9_-]+|app\.vidcast\.io/share/[A-Za-z0-9_-]+(\?playerMode=vidcast)?|github\.com/user-attachments/assets/[A-Za-z0-9-]+)' --include='*.md' . | sort -u
+  ```
+
+  Every URL the scan returns must appear on this page; if you add a new demo video anywhere in the repo, add one row to the Quick Index and one section entry here.
+- Follow-ups tracked separately: add `- Demo Videos: demo-videos.md` to the nav in `mkdocs.yml` so the page appears in the rendered docs site; fix the broken `#demo-videos` anchor link in `docs/index.md` (it points to a README anchor that does not exist).
+- Last verified against v1.24.3.
